      "prompt": "5/8 - 2/8 = ？",
      "options": ["3/0", "3/8", "3/16", "3/4"],
      "correctAnswer": "3/8",
      "explanation": "同分母分数减法：分母不变，分子相减。5/8 - 2/8 = (5-2)/8 = 3/8。分母还是8，分子5-2=3。",
      "points": 10,
      "primarySkillId": "frac.add_sub_same_denominator",
      "evidenceType": "procedural"
    },
    {
