        "分母不变，分子相加减",
        "分母和分子都相加",
        "分母相乘，分子相加"
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "分母不变，分子相加减",
      "explanation": "同分母分数加减法，分母不变（因为每一份大小一样），只把分子相加或相减。这是最核心的规则。",
      "points": 10,
      "primarySkillId": "frac.add_sub_same_denominator",
      "evidenceType": "conceptual"
    },
    {
      "id": "q4",
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": "1/3 + 2/3 = ？",
      "options": ["3/6", "3/3", "1", "3/3或1"],
      "correctAnswer": "3/3或1",
      "explanation": "1/3 + 2/3 = (1+2)/3 = 3/3。当分子等于分母时，就是整体1，所以3/3 = 1。",
      "points": 10,
      "primarySkillId": "frac.one_boundary",
      "secondarySkillIds": ["frac.add_sub_same_denominator"],
      "evidenceType": "conceptual"
    },
    {
