      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": "妈妈把蛋糕平均分成6份，你吃了1份（1/6），爸爸吃了3份（3/6），一共吃了几分之几？",
      "options": ["4/12", "4/6", "3/6", "1/2"],
      "correctAnswer": "4/6",
      "explanation": "1/6 + 3/6 = (1+3)/6 = 4/6。分母不变还是6，分子1+3=4。两人一共吃了蛋糕的4/6。",
      "points": 10,
      "primarySkillId": "frac.add_sub_same_denominator",
      "secondarySkillIds": ["frac.same_whole"],
      "evidenceType": "procedural"
    },
